<Box style={{width: 1280, height: 720, background: "#FAFAF7", padding: "28px 64px 24px", flexDirection: "column", fontFamily: "PingFang SC"}}><Box style={{height: 96, flexDirection: "column", justifyContent: "center"}}><Text style={{fontFamily: "SF Mono", fontSize: 14, color: "rgba(28,31,35,0.40)", letterSpacing: 1}}>第一幕 · 五层演变</Text><Text style={{fontSize: 36, fontWeight: 600, color: "#1C1F23", lineHeight: 1.25, marginTop: 10}}>模型越强，工程杠杆点越往上移</Text></Box><Box style={{height: 532, flexDirection: "row", gap: 40}}><Box style={{width: 430, flexDirection: "column", justifyContent: "center"}}><Text style={{fontFamily: "SF Mono", fontSize: 120, fontWeight: 700, color: "#0F6E56", lineHeight: 1.0, letterSpacing: -2}}>7</Text><Text style={{fontSize: 22, color: "rgba(28,31,35,0.62)", marginTop: 12}}>个月 —— METR：50% 可靠性任务长度约每 7 个月翻倍</Text><Text style={{fontSize: 24, fontWeight: 600, color: "#1C1F23", marginTop: 26}}>模型能力更强，可以交给模型的活就越长</Text><Text style={{fontSize: 18, color: "rgba(28,31,35,0.55)", lineHeight: 1.6, marginTop: 10}}>单次交互的边际工程收益随之下降：调措辞、塞上下文的回报在缩水。</Text></Box><Box style={{width: 682, flexDirection: "column", gap: 16, justifyContent: "center"}}><Box style={{flex: 1, flexDirection: "column", padding: 22, background: "rgba(28,31,35,0.035)", borderRadius: 8}}><Text style={{fontSize: 22, fontWeight: 600, color: "#1C1F23"}}>模型能力更强</Text><Text style={{fontSize: 20, color: "rgba(28,31,35,0.70)", lineHeight: 1.55, marginTop: 10}}>能交给模型的活越来越长</Text></Box><Box style={{flex: 1, flexDirection: "column", padding: 22, background: "rgba(28,31,35,0.035)", borderRadius: 8}}><Text style={{fontSize: 22, fontWeight: 600, color: "#1C1F23"}}>边际工程收益更低</Text><Text style={{fontSize: 20, color: "rgba(28,31,35,0.70)", lineHeight: 1.55, marginTop: 10}}>调措辞、塞上下文的回报在缩水</Text></Box><Box style={{flex: 1, flexDirection: "column", padding: 22, background: "rgba(15,110,86,0.07)", borderRadius: 8}}><Text style={{fontSize: 22, fontWeight: 600, color: "#0F6E56"}}>工程杠杆点上移</Text><Text style={{fontSize: 20, color: "rgba(28,31,35,0.70)", lineHeight: 1.55, marginTop: 10}}>工程对象从「一句话」移到「系统」</Text></Box><Box style={{flexDirection: "column", padding: 22, background: "rgba(138,90,0,0.07)", borderRadius: 8}}><Text style={{fontSize: 24, fontWeight: 600, color: "#1C1F23"}}>每往上一层，都是对下面一层做了一个假设</Text><Text style={{fontSize: 18, color: "rgba(28,31,35,0.55)", lineHeight: 1.65, marginTop: 10}}>Prompt→Context「模型能吃上下文」／Context→Harness「环境受控」／Harness→Loop「单次运行受控」／Loop→Graph「单 agent 受控」。<br />每个假设在极限处都可能失效。</Text></Box></Box></Box><Box style={{height: 40, flexDirection: "row", justifyContent: "space-between", alignItems: "flex-end"}}><Text style={{fontFamily: "SF Mono", fontSize: 14, color: "rgba(28,31,35,0.35)"}}>AI CODING EVOLUTION</Text><Text style={{fontFamily: "SF Mono", fontSize: 14, color: "rgba(28,31,35,0.45)"}}>05 / 45</Text></Box></Box>
